    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d934">

                <pb facs="1088" n="992" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg992"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-07-25"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 25,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Additional inquiry from Spanish Government just received through British minister
                    for foreign affairs as to whether Transatlantic Company steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">San Augustin</hi> now at San Martinique fitted as
                    hospital ship, with medical officers aboard, can be used to transport wounded to
                    Spain. If request is granted the vessel will be sent immediately to Santiago de
                    Cuba under same previously proposed conditions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
